# RaceDay - API Endpoint Plan
## Base URL: `/api`
---
## 1. AUTHENTICATION ENDPOINTS
| HTTP Method | Route | Description | Role Required | Request Body | Expected Response |
|-------------|-------|-------------|---------------|--------------|-------------------|
| POST | /auth/register | Register new user | None | `{"email":"string","password":"string","firstName":"string","lastName":"string","idNumber":"string","phoneNumber":"string","dateOfBirth":"date","gender":"string","role":"string"}` | `201 Created` `{"userId":1,"email":"user@email.com","role":"Participant"}` |
| POST | /auth/login | Login user | None | `{"email":"string","password":"string"}` | `200 OK` `{"token":"jwt_token","userId":1,"email":"user@email.com","role":"Participant"}` |
| POST | /auth/logout | Logout user | Authenticated | `{}` | `200 OK` `{"message":"Logged out"}` |
---
## 2. USER PROFILE ENDPOINTS
| HTTP Method | Route | Description | Role Required | Request Body | Expected Response |
|-------------|-------|-------------|---------------|--------------|-------------------|
| GET | /users/{id} | Get user profile | Authenticated | None | `200 OK` `{"userId":1,"email":"user@email.com","firstName":"John","lastName":"Doe","phoneNumber":"0821234567","role":"Participant"}` |
| PUT | /users/{id} | Update profile | Authenticated | `{"firstName":"string","lastName":"string","phoneNumber":"string","dateOfBirth":"date"}` | `200 OK` `{"message":"Profile updated","user":{...}}` |
| GET | /users/{id}/enrolments | Get user enrolments | Participant | None | `200 OK` `[{"enrolmentId":1,"eventName":"Durban Marathon","status":"Confirmed"}]` |
| GET | /users/{id}/results | Get user results | Participant | None | `200 OK` `[{"resultId":1,"eventName":"Durban Marathon","finishTime":"01:45:30","position":15}]` |
---
## 3. EVENT ENDPOINTS
| HTTP Method | Route | Description | Role Required | Request Body | Expected Response |
|-------------|-------|-------------|---------------|--------------|-------------------|
| GET | /events | Get all events | None | None | `200 OK` `[{"eventId":1,"eventName":"Durban Summer Marathon","eventDate":"2026-12-15","city":"Durban"}]` |
| GET | /events/{id} | Get event by ID | None | None | `200 OK` `{"eventId":1,"eventName":"Durban Summer Marathon","organiserName":"John Durban","categories":[...]}` |
| POST | /events | Create event | Organiser | `{"eventName":"string","eventType":"string","eventDate":"date","city":"string","province":"string"}` | `201 Created` `{"eventId":1,"message":"Event created"}` |
| PUT | /events/{id} | Update event | Organiser | `{"eventName":"string","eventDate":"date","city":"string"}` | `200 OK` `{"message":"Event updated"}` |
| DELETE | /events/{id} | Delete event | Organiser | None | `204 No Content` |
| GET | /events/{id}/categories | Get event categories | None | None | `200 OK` `[{"categoryId":1,"categoryName":"Full Marathon","distance":42.2}]` |
| GET | /events/{id}/enrolments | Get event enrolments | Organiser | None | `200 OK` `[{"enrolmentId":1,"participantName":"Mike Soweto","status":"Confirmed"}]` |
